          "jcr:created": "Fri Jun 14 2019 17:05:30 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>The content on this website has been made available for informational and educational purposes only.</p>\n<p>The technologies and/or surgical techniques discussed on this website and in the video content made available are descriptions based on clinical use or research conducted in the presenter’s individual capacity. Stryker does not dispense medical advice and none of the information presented should be confused as medical advice. The views and opinions of the presenter are his/her own. A surgeon must always rely on his or her own professional clinical judgment when deciding whether to use a particular product when treating a particular patient. A surgeon who performs any particular procedure is responsible for determining and utilizing the appropriate techniques for such procedure in each individual patient based on their particular characteristics and based on the surgeon's clinical judgment, knowledge and education. Stryker is in no way responsible for surgical credentialing or training in surgical procedure or technique, nor are the training programs provided by Stryker a replacement for hospital or professional society credentialing requirements. A surgeon must always refer to the package insert, product label and/or instructions for use before using any of Stryker's products.</p>\n<p>Stryker does not make any warranties about the completeness, reliability and accuracy of this information. Any action you take upon the information you find on this website (<a href=\"http://www.Stryker.com\">www.Stryker.com</a>), is strictly at your own risk. Stryker is not responsible nor liable for any advice, course of treatment, diagnosis or any other information that you obtain through this website and Stryker will not be liable for any losses and/or damages in connection with the use of our website.</p>\n<p>By using our website, you hereby consent to our disclaimer and agree to its terms.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jul 15 2019 16:23:06 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
